# The Vercel CLI uploads from DISK, not from git — so a directory being
# gitignored does not protect it. covenant/deploy/target is a Rust build
# directory and is 2.3 GB; uploading it aborts the deploy on repeat, with an
# error that names neither the size nor the file.
#
# Nothing here is needed to build a function: the source that matters is
# mcp/deploy/api, and its dependencies come from npm at build time.

.git
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Rust build output — the big one
target
**/target

# TypeScript build output; npm consumers get it from the published tarball
dist
**/dist

# Working files this repo accumulates
_gitjunk
_to_delete
*.tgz
*.log

# Never upload key material or pulled environment, whatever else changes here
*.key
.env*
**/.env*
